fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
# /fork (fx e4348723) after three turns: the menu (newest selected, three
# lines a prompt), its keys and Escape; a fork before the second prompt, the
# restored composer, the transcript lines, the title; the fork going on;
# /status naming it; /resume listing it; the exit line; both logs.
gateway p5-effort-fork-turns.json
wait 3
type first prompt alpha
key Enter
wait 3
type second prompt beta
key Enter
wait 3
type third prompt gamma that runs long enough to wrap past three lines of the fork menu at this width so the menu has to cut it and end the third line with an ellipsis rather than show every word of it, one two three four five six seven eight nine ten eleven twelve thirteen fourteen fifteen and then a good deal more so that the prompt needs a fourth and a fifth line at a hundred and twenty columns, sixteen seventeen eighteen nineteen twenty twenty-one twenty-two twenty-three twenty-four
key Enter
wait 3
type /fo
wait 0.6
snap slash-fo
key C-u
wait 0.3
type /fork
key Enter
wait 1
snap menu
key Up
wait 0.3
snap up1
key Up
wait 0.3
snap up2
key Up
wait 0.3
snap up3-clamp
key Down
wait 0.3
snap down
key Escape
wait 0.5
snap esc
type /fork
key Enter
wait 1
key Up
wait 0.3
key Enter
wait 3
snap forked
snapfull forked
title forked
home after-fork
key Enter
wait 3
snap continued
type /status
key Enter
wait 1
snap status
key Escape
wait 0.5
type /resume
key Enter
wait 2
snap resume
key Escape
wait 0.5
type /new
key Enter
wait 1.5
type /resume
key Enter
wait 2
snap resume-both
key Down
wait 0.3
snap resume-both-down
key Up
wait 0.3
key Enter
wait 3
snap resumed-fork
keep
type /quit
key Enter
wait 2
snap quit
home end
gwlog
